# s129-across.pad — S129: from s129-train.toml's across state (bike 70 ft short of the z≈2318 rail,
# facing it, saved with both brakes held as the engine passes), let go and hold the gas into the
# passing train. Quarter speed: 4000 ms a game second.
#
#   ./kit record watch/s129-train.toml --state 10 --pad watch/pads/s129-across.pad -n 300
release
down cross
sleep 44000
release
